; The exhaustive Nat gap dichotomy chooses the actual
; proved norm degree, then constructor arithmetic and leading-degree
; uniqueness exclude1. No maximum formula or desired norm fact is
; supplied as a hypothesis; both input degrees include0.
(#alias add = ./../fermat_statement.lim::add)
